# HELP spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status The number of workers in a worker pool by status: idle, busy, draining (drained and busy) or drained (drained and idle). draining plus drained counts the workers in spacelift_worker_pool_workers_drained, and busy plus draining normally equals spacelift_worker_pool_workers_busy
